  "content": "\n\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\">V14 版本发布！<br>- 教程地图已重制为更线性的教程玩法，希望包含更易理解的概念和几段战斗内容</h3>\n<hr>\n<p><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><strong>（本次更新新增的模组以蓝色字体显示）</strong></span></p>\n<h1><strong>1. 枪械包</strong></h1>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"><strong>本整合包尽可能包含了最少的科幻或不可自定义武器。这并不意味着每一件武器都会完全写实或可自定义。这里大约有 400 种独特武器。</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"><strong>本整合包充斥着大量虚构枪械和重复模型。请使用右侧的“足够多的物品”（JEI）库存界面，来欣赏我亲自挑选的、仅包含写实且独特枪械的精选列表。</strong></span></p>\n<h2><span style=\"color:#fff\"><em><strong>枪械模组列表如下：</strong></em></span></h2>\n<h4><span style=\"color:#fff\">- [ 模组名称 ] - [ 作者名称 ] - <strong><em>[ 授权协议 ]</em></strong></span></h4>\n<h4><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"><span style=\"color:#c2e0f4\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">[ 已在 v13.5 删除 ] -&nbsp;<a style=\"color:#e03e2d\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/superb-warfare\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">[SBW] Superb Warfare</a> - Mercurows <span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong>推荐！</strong></span></span></span></span></h4>\n<h4><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"><span style=\"color:#c2e0f4\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">[ 已在 v13.5 删除 ] - <a style=\"color:#e03e2d\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mcsp-military-vehicle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">[SBW] MCSP - ADDON</a> - Tornqvista <strong><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">&nbsp;推荐！</span></strong></span></span></span></h4>\n<h4><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"><em><strong>- </strong></em><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tacz-addons-daffas-arsenal\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">[TACZ Addons] Daffa's Arsenal</a> - dafafatan </span><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><span style=\"color:#c2e0f4\"><em><strong>[ 自定义协议 ]</strong></em></span></span></h4>\n<h4><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><span style=\"color:#7e8c8d\">-</span> </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/maxstuff\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow