stered</a> - henkelmax<span style=\"color:#c2e0f4\"> <em><strong>[遵循 GNU 协议]</strong></em></span></span></h4>\n<h4><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">- <a style=\"color:#95a5a6\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/starlight-forge\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Starlight</a> - SpottedStar</span> <span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"><span style=\"color:#c2e0f4\"><em><strong>[遵循 GNU 协议]</strong></em></span></span></h4>\n<h4><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"><span style=\"color:#c2e0f4\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">-&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><span style=\"color:#c2e0f4\"><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"><a style=\"color:#95a5a6\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tacz-additions\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">TACZ Additions</a> - Raiiiden </span></span></span><span style=\"color:#c2e0f4\"><em><strong><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"><span style=\"color:#c2e0f4\">[保留所有权利]</span></span></strong></em></span></h4>\n<h4><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"><span style=\"color:#c2e0f4\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">-&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><span style=\"color:#c2e0f4\"><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"><a style=\"color:#95a5a6\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tacz-addon\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">TACZ Addon</a> - MerrySnow<em><strong>&nbsp;</strong></em></span></span></span><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"><span style=\"color:#c2e0f4\"><em><strong>[遵循 GNU 协议]</strong></em></span></span></h4>\n<h4><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"><span style=\"color:#c2e0f4\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">-&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><span style=\"color:#c2e0f4\"><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"><a style=\"color:#95a5a6\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tacz-ammo-query\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">TACZ Ammo Query </a>&nbsp;- Mira090 </span></span></span><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"><span style=\"color:#c2e0f4\"><em><strong><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"><span style=\"color:#c2e0f4\"><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><span style=\"color:#c2e0f4\">[遵循 MIT 许可证]</span></span></span></span></strong></em></span></span></span></h4>\n<h4><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><span style=\"color:#c2e0f4\"><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">- <a style=\"color:#95a5a6\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tacz-bullet-proof-enchant-add-on\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">TACZ Bullet Proof Enchant Forge Add-on</a> - zwachinabottle</span> </span></span><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"><span style=\"color:#c2e0f4\"><em><strong>[遵循 MIT 许可证]</strong></em></span></span></span></h4>\n<h4><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"><span style=\"color:#c2e0f4\"><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"><span style=\"color:#c2e0f4\"><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><span style=\"color:#7e8c8d\">-</span> </span></span></span><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"><a style=\"color:#95a5a6\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tacz-tweaks\" rel=\"nofollow\">TaCZ Tweaks</a> - MUKSC <em><strong><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"><span style=\"color:#c2e0f4\">[遵循 GNU 协议]</span></span></strong></em></span></span></span></span></h4>\n<h4><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"><span style=\"color:#c2e0f4\"><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"><span style=\"color:#c2e0f4\"><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><span style=\"color:#7e8c8d\">-</span> </span></span></span><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"><a style=\"color:#95a5a6\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tacz-leaning\" rel=\"nofollow\">Tacz: Leaning</a> -Nwkey </span></span></span></span><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"><span style=\"color:#c2e0f4\"><em><strong><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"><span style=\"color:#c2e0f4\"><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><span style=\"color:#c2e0f4\">[遵循 MIT 许可证]</span></span></span></span></strong></em></span></span></span></h4>\n<h4><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"><span style=\"color:#c2e0f4\"><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"><span style=\"color:#c2e0f4\"><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><span style=\"color:#7e8c8d\">-</span>&nbsp;</span></span></span><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tacz-npcs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">TACZ: Npcs</a> - Jeducklet</span><em><strong><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"><span style=\"color:#c2e0f4\"><span style=\"color:#3598db\"> <span style=\"color:#c2e0f4\">[遵循 MIT 许可证]</span> </span></span></span></strong></em><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"><span style=\"color:#c2e0f4\"><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">(旧版本)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></h4>\n<h4><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"><span style=\"color:#c2e0f4\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">[已在 v13.5 中移除] - <a style=\"color:#e03e2d\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tacz-arcana-timeless-and-classics-guns\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">TacZ:Arcana</a> - hamsterbaron <strong><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">强烈推荐！</span></strong></span></span></span></span></h4>\n<h4><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">- <a style=\"color:#95a5a6\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/the-lost-cities\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">The Lost Cities</a> - McJty <span style=\"color:#c2e0f4\"><strong><em>[遵循 MIT 许可证]</em></strong></span></span></h4>\n<h4><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"><span style=\"color:#c2e0f4\"><span style=\"color:#7e8c8d\">- </span><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/third-person-shooting\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Third Person Shooting: Zero</a> - chloe_koopa </span></span></span><em><strong><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"><span style=\"color:#c2e0f4\">[遵循 GNU 协议]</span></span></strong></em></h4>\n<h4><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"><span style=\"color:#c2e0f4\"><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"><span style=\"color:#c2e0f4\"><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><em><span style=\"color:#7e8c8d\">-</span></em></span></span></span></span></span></span> <span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/vulcans-flashlights\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Vulcan's Flashlights</a> - AlaharranHonor&nbsp;</span><em><strong><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"><span style=\"color:#c2e0f4\">[遵循 GNU 协议]</span></span></strong></em></h4>\n<h4>&nbsp;</h4>\n<p><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong><em>- （还有少量其他模组，但它们作为库文件已包含在自动安装机制中。若将这些模组放入整合包，它们将自动安装。）</em></strong></span></p>\n<h4><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"><span style=\"color:#c2e0f4\"><em><strong><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"><span style=\"color:#c2e0f4\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span></strong></em></span></span></h4>\n<h2><strong><span style=\"color:#fff\">2.1. 关于 AutoHUD</span></strong></h2>\n<h4><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">当未切换物品时，会自动隐藏 HUD。按下 \"<strong>B</strong>\" 键可开关此功能。长按 \" <strong>&ordm;</strong> \"（位于 \"<strong>1</strong>\" 左侧的按键）即可演示效果。该模组支持高度自定义配置。如需修改我预设的内容，请前往 [Tacz Expanded]/config/autohud.json5</span></h4>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2><strong><span style=\"color:#fff\">2.2 关于 Shoulder Surfing Reloaded</span></strong></h2>\n<h4><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">前往画廊部分以了解本模组。简单来说，它允许你自由调整第三人称视角。按下 \"鼠标按键5\"（上键）可切换视角，或前往 Minecraft 菜单：设置 > 控制 > 按键绑定，搜索 \"toggle camera view\" 进行修改。</span></h4>\n<h4>&nbsp;</h4>\n<h2><strong><span style=\"color:#fff\">2.3 关于 TaCZ Tweaks&nbsp;</span></strong></h2>\n<h4><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"><strong>这是一个重要说明，请仔细阅读。</strong> 在本整合包中体验射击玩法有两种方式。你可以像《现代战争2019》、《战地2042》或《三角洲部队》那样持枪奔跑（得益于战术冲刺资源包），或者同时奔跑并开火换弹。若两者同时进行，会出现奇怪且不适的动画，因此请按需选择。若选择第二种，请前往 Minecraft 菜单：模组，按 Z-A 排序找到本模组，点击“Configure”，进入移动设置，找到类似“sprint behavior”（奔跑行为）的选项。默认设置为奔跑时无法换弹，但你可以自行更改。保存后即可实现边跑边换弹！该模组还包含大量其他功能，不妨多探索一下。</span></h4>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2><span style=\"color:#fff\"><strong>2.4 关于 Multi Summon Command</strong></span></h2>\n<h4><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">相比频繁输入召唤指令，它能帮助你一次性召唤多个敌对生物进行战斗。</span></h4>\n<h4><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"><code>/multisummon &lt;要召唤的生物数量&gt; &lt;生物ID&gt; [&lt;坐标&gt;] [&lt;NBT标签&gt;]<br>示例：/multisummon 40 zombie&nbsp;</code></span></h4>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2><span style=\"color:#fff\"><strong>2.5 关于 Controllable&nbsp;</strong></span></h2>\n<h4><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"><strong>借助 Controllable 模组，你现在可以使用手柄游玩 TACZ Expanded。我已为 PS4 的 DualShock 手柄映射了按键，但你也可以在选项菜单中自定义自己的按键。</strong></span></h4>\n<h4>&nbsp;</h4>\n<h2><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"><strong><span style=\"color:#fff\">2.6 更多功能将在世界“Modpack tutorial”内展示。</span>&nbsp;</strong></span></h2>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<hr>\n<h1><strong>3. 资源包（可在游戏内开启/关闭）</strong></h1>\n\n<h4><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"><a style=\"color:#95a5a6\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/tac-sprint-tacz-edition\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">战术冲刺</a>，由 Zendy 制作</span></h4>\n<h4 style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">该模组计入资源包，并将正常的跑步动画替换为《现代战争2019》及后续作品、《战地2042》或《三角洲部队（战争）》中的战术冲刺动画。&nbsp;</span></h4>\n<h4 style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">如果您使用 1.4 版本，此资源包将<strong>无法正常工作</strong>，因此如果它意外自动更新，请<strong>务必使用 1.3 版本</strong>。</span> <span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><span style=\"color:#c2e0f4\"><em><strong>[版权保留]</strong></em></span></span></h4>\n<h4 style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</h4>\n<h4 style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"color:#fff\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/tissous-zombie-pack-optifine-1-7x-1-20\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">Tissou 的僵尸包</span></a><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">，由 Tissou 制作</span></span></h4>\n<p><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">原版僵尸不够吓人？这些僵尸看起来更加腐烂、恐怖，且发出的声音也更具威胁性。本整合包并非僵尸生存向，因此没有额外内容让它们变得更强或更快。你可以自行添加相关模组。&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><span style=\"color:#c2e0f4\"><em><strong>[版权保留]</strong></em></span></span></p>\n<h4><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"><a style=\"color:#95a5a6\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/ambience-sounds-pack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">AmbientSound6 音效包</a>，由 AS12 制作&nbsp;<br></span></h4>\n<h4><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">根据天气和生物群系提供背景环境音。在保持真实感的同时完美提升沉浸感。</span> <span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><span style=\"color:#c2e0f4\"><em><strong>[遵循 MIT 协议]</strong></em></span></span></h4>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"><a style=\"color:#95a5a6\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/default-dark-mode\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Default Dark Mode</a>，由 nebulr 制作&nbsp;</span></p>\n<h4><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">它将界面改为深色模式。</span> <span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><span style=\"color:#c2e0f4\"><em><strong>[自定义协议]</strong></em></span></span></h4>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<hr>\n<h1><strong>4. 光影包</strong>&nbsp;</h1>\n<p><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">- <a style=\"color:#95a5a6\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/shaders/bliss-shader\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bliss 光影</a> 与 Unbou</span><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">nd 类似。在此情况下，它使氛围更加生动且略带诡异感，类似于《现代战争》系列作品的风格。它的运行效率比 Unbound 稍好，且几乎拥有相同的自定义选项。&nbsp; <strong>作者：Xonk___</strong> <span style=\"color:#c2e0f4\"><em><strong>[自定义协议]&nbsp;</strong></em></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">- <a style=\"color:#95a5a6;text-decoration:underline\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/shaders/body-camera-shader\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Bodycam 摄像机光影</strong></a> 为你提供带有自定义视觉模式的防弹衣摄像头滤镜：常规、绿色夜视、蓝色夜视和白色红外。此光影包中的所有内容均可自定义，从鱼眼镜头强度到让画面叠加细微线条以模拟录制效果的 VHS 透明度。<strong>作者：LoLip_p</strong> <span style=\"color:#c2e0f4\"><em><strong>[遵循 CC 协议]&nbsp;</strong></em></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"><span style=\"color:#c2e0f4\"><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"><em><strong>- </strong></em><a style=\"color:#95a5a6\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/shaders/complementary-unbound\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Complementary Shaders - Unbound</a></span> <span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">让游戏更具电影感，尽管不一定完全写实。可以把它当作《战地4》的滤镜。它能通过优美的水面反射和光照泛光效果让一切看起来极其鲜艳（除非你不想！）。<strong>作者：EminGT <em><span style=\"color:#c2e0f4\">[自定义协议]</span></em></strong></span><em><strong><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"><span style=\"color:#c2e0f4\"><br><br><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><span style=\"color:#7e8c8d\">- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/shaders/bsl-shaders\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">BSL 光影</a> </span></span></span></span></strong></em><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"><span style=\"color:#c2e0f4\"><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><span style=\"color:#7e8c8d\">可进行深度自定义，让你随意调整成写实或卡通风格。还支持导入他人的配置文件。<strong>作者：capttatsu </strong></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"><span style=\"color:#c2e0f4\"><em><strong>[版权保留]</strong></em></span></span></p>\n<hr>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:left\"><strong>5. 地图</strong></h1>\n<h4><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><span style=\"color:#7e8c8d\">-</span>&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"><a style=\"color:#95a5a6\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252fproject%252fbattlefield-4-operation-metro-2014-3472993%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">战地4 “地铁2014行动”</a>，由 YvviS 制作。在最后一次更新中，为整合包内所有出现在《战地4》、《战地1》或《战地6》中的枪械添加了宝箱。用海晶灯替换了地铁站一楼的萤石，使其灯光效果更贴近原游戏。</span></h4>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h4><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><strong><em><span style=\"color:#7e8c8d\">-&nbsp;</span></em></strong></span></span><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"><a style=\"color:#95a5a6\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252fproject%252fcall-of-duty-modern-warfare-shipment-6061286%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">使命召唤：现代战争｜运输船</a>，由 Block Horizon 制作。为整合包内所有出现在《MW19》之后任何《使命召唤》作品中的枪械添加了宝箱。</span></h4>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h4><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><strong><span style=\"color:#3598db\">&nbsp;</span><em><span style=\"color:#7e8c8d\">-&nbsp;</span></em></strong></span></span><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">我自己发现的一个优质种子。我在山顶添加了一个可爱的前哨站，并在前方修建了一条通往村庄的小阶梯，后方则连接着一座大型矿洞。非常适合拍摄风景照。<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=DemqlnXEFNw\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">MRAP 由 MC Military Force 制作。</a>&nbsp;</span></h4>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">- 整合包使用教程。解释了关于 TACZ 和 Superb 的大部分功能（适用于 v13 及以下版本）。由我本人制作。</span></p>\n<hr>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">更换皮肤以获得完整沉浸感。<a style=\"color:#2dc26b\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.minecraft.net%252fes-es%252fmsaprofile%252fmygames\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">点击此处</a>进入 Java 版皮肤更改器。如果你想要一些我觉得质量不错的装备皮肤，<a style=\"color:#2dc26b\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252fskins%252f%253fkeywords%253dbf4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">请点击这里</a></span></strong></h3>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d;text-decoration:underline\"><strong>如果在游玩本整合包时感到头晕，请在评论区告知我。</strong></span></span></p>",
